@PlayerInfo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5011
@CronSecret = change-me

### 1. Health check
GET {{PlayerInfo_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Add tracked team (Manchester United)
POST {{PlayerInfo_HostAddress}}/api/watchlist/teams
Content-Type: application/json
X-Cron-Secret: {{CronSecret}}

{
  "externalApiId": 33,
  "name": "Manchester United",
  "country": "England",
  "leagueExternalId": 39
}

### 3. Add search keyword alias
POST {{PlayerInfo_HostAddress}}/api/watchlist/aliases
Content-Type: application/json
X-Cron-Secret: {{CronSecret}}

{
  "entityType": "Team",
  "entityId": 1,
  "keyword": "Manchester United",
  "language": "en"
}

### 4. Trigger news collection
POST {{PlayerInfo_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/run?mode=news
Accept: application/json
X-Cron-Secret: {{CronSecret}}

### 5. View collected news
GET {{PlayerInfo_HostAddress}}/api/news?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### 6. Check daily API quota
GET {{PlayerInfo_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/quota
Accept: application/json
